# Anti-AI UI

Run `npm run anti-ai-ui` to enforce. The check must stay green.

## Banned patterns

- **Inter font** — do not import or reference Inter. Lobby Plate specifies IBM Plex Sans / Archivo Narrow.
- **Purple accent palette** — no `#7c3aed`, `#8b5cf6`, or similar purple hex values as primary/accent.
- **Card grids** — no uniform card grid layouts (the "every SaaS landing page" pattern).
- **Nightglass** — no dark + grain + neon-mint combination (dark background with grain texture and `#4ade80`-class mint accents).
- **Gradient hero blobs** — no decorative gradient blur circles/blobs in hero sections.
- **"Get Started" + "Learn More" button pairs** — use domain-specific copy.

These patterns signal AI-generated UI and must be caught before merge.
